en_US:
During the day, I sunbathe.
During the night, I moonbathe...{VAR BE00}
Nature sinks into my body.

Derleth: The only things that come out
of my mouth are my whistle tunes and{VAR BE00}
complaints about my life.{VAR BE01}
This bridge is a meeting place for people
like me who like to complain.

Aickman: Y-you have great sparkles...
Sparkles in your eyes.{VAR BE01}
Please make our hopes, our dreams,
come true for us.{VAR BE01}
Go grab the glory--go take on the world!

Russo: Now, you're the first person in an
awful long time who's hung around to{VAR BE00}
listen and hear what I was singin' about.{VAR BE01}
Much obliged!

Welcome!{VAR BE01}
Thank you for making a reservation
for a battle!{VAR BE01}

That's great! I'm so glad!{VAR BE01}
That said, do you already know
what you'll be doing?

This shop is a special sandwich shop.
You'll take orders from customers.{VAR BE01}
Then, I'll make sandwiches to fill
their orders.{VAR BE01}

You'll serve the sandwiches to the
customers who ordered them.{VAR BE01}
Please be careful, and don't serve them
to the wrong customers!{VAR BE01}

Let me give you a review!
Your work was...{VAR BE01}
Perfect! The customers seem to
be satisfied, too.{VAR BE01}

I have a review for you.
Your work was...{VAR BE01}
Well, you still need some practice.
But you'll get used to it soon!{VAR BE01}

Nibble, nibble...{VAR BE01}
Oh dear. It's lovely, but this is not
my order.
